5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's actually like to live next to these things! I'll check the visit to the station block's bin house and the supervised mornings on the next lane.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I think it would be helpful to know the costs. I'll look into the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, and the block ledger of refuse-point expenses.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take a look at the station block's meeting minutes and the statements at the residents' meeting to see how people are actually getting along.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'll check the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk. I want to know how much work this actually is.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the ward complaint log for this point and the measurements of the five frontages to see if the current setup is fair.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,Does anyone else think we should check the complaint log? I'm curious if people are really that upset!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Asuka is already handling the complaint log, so we can just wait for her to tell us what she finds.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. There's no need to double up on the research when we have a list this long. Let's just stick to our assignments for now.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I agree. Let's just get the facts first so we can actually decide something without guessing.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree. I will focus on the data and report back exactly what the logs and measurements show.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I wonder if the station block's bin house is pretty! I hope it's not too scary or smelly.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"We should keep an open mind, Rin. I'm sure it's just a practical building, but your curiosity will help us see things from a different perspective.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Practicality is the goal here, not aesthetics. Let's just make sure we don't get distracted by the ""pretty"" parts and focus on whether it actually works.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm more worried about the logistics. If the paperwork is a nightmare, we might be stuck with whatever we have now regardless of how ""pretty"" it is.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Logistics are indeed a priority, but we must also ensure the physical layout allows for a fair distribution of the burden. I will be thorough with the measurements.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready to find out! I'll go see the bin house and the other lane right now!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll go check on the costs and the ledger. I hope we can find a solution that works for everyone's budget.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll dig into the minutes and the meeting statements. Let's see if we can find a way to settle this without starting another war.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"I'll get the truck times and the filing rules. I'm not looking forward to the bureaucracy, but someone has to do it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will proceed with the complaint log and the frontage measurements. I'll see you all when the information is gathered.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
