31,2,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The bin house was actually really smelly in the summer, and the supervised mornings on the next lane only take about fifty minutes!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I found that the ward offers a forty percent subsidy up to ninety thousand yen, but last year's shelters averaged about two hundred forty-eight thousand yen.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The station block's minutes show they ended up fighting over broken latches and sweeping, and at the meeting, nobody actually wanted to be the one to turn away a neighbor's late bag.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The truck arrives between 7:40 and 8:15, and the clerk says a permanent build needs a site plan, five signatures, and four months of waiting.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The complaint log shows fourteen entries in three years, eleven from the household at the current site, and the frontages vary significantly, with one being very narrow.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Wait, if the bin house smells that bad, maybe we shouldn't build one! That sounds like a nightmare for whoever lives next to it.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Rin. If it smells that much, it might not be worth the cost, especially since the subsidy only covers a portion of the total expense.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"And if the station block is already fighting over who sweeps the floor, adding a permanent structure here might just give us something new to argue about.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"Plus, that four-month waiting period and the need for five signatures sounds like a total headache. Why make it so complicated if it's just going to cause more fights?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"The fact that one household filed almost all the complaints proves the current location is unsustainable, but the narrowness of some frontages makes a simple rotation difficult.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"If we can't build a house and we can't move it easily, maybe we can just watch it for a little bit like the other lane does!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"That sounds like a gentle approach, but we should consider if everyone can manage the time and if it solves the smell and complaint issues.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"The problem is that nobody wants to be the ""bad guy"" and tell a neighbor their bag is late, so supervising might just be a polite way of doing nothing.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"Exactly, and with the truck arriving as early as 7:40, some of us would have to be out there before we've even had coffee. It's a lot of pressure for a short window.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we keep the point where it is, we are ignoring the fact that one person has borne the burden for years, which is logically unacceptable.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"But if we move it, we might just make someone else sad! Maybe we can find a way to make it fair without making it smelly or scary.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm worried that if we move it, we might just be shifting the problem. We need a solution that doesn't put too much financial or emotional stress on any one person.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's be honest, we're just trying to avoid a blow-up. If we rotate the location, we might just be rotating the resentment around the block.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"I'm just thinking about the time. If we rotate, we're just rotating the paperwork and the stress of moving things every few months. It sounds like a lot of effort for very little gain.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"Regardless of the effort, we cannot justify leaving the current resident in a position where they feel compelled to file eleven complaints in three years.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
56,3,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
