59,3,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
60,3,1,talk,Rin,,I want to pick something that makes everyone happy! Which options do we have to choose from now?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"We have three options: Managed Collection Hours, where we take turns overseeing the current spot; Rotating Location, where the point moves between our houses; or an Enclosed Structure, which is a permanent build.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Given the fighting over sweeping and the smell Rin mentioned, the Enclosed Structure seems like a recipe for disaster. I'm leaning away from that one.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"I'm with Shunichi on that. Between the four-month wait and the early truck times, Managed Collection Hours sounds like a chore, but Rotating Location seems like a logistical mess.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Rotating Location is the only option that addresses the fundamental unfairness of the current site, despite the frontage differences.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"If we rotate, does that mean the smelly bags move too? I don't want anyone to be sad because it's their turn to have the smell!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"That's a good point, Rin. If we rotate, the smell moves with the bins, but at least no one person has to deal with it all year long.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It's the most honest way to handle it. We share the annoyance equally, and nobody can claim they're being singled out or ignored by the rest of us.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"I still hate the idea of moving things around, but it's better than spending a fortune on a smelly box or waking up at 7:00 AM to play bin police.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,Exactly. It is the only logical way to ensure that the burden of the refuse point is distributed equitably among all five households.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,I think rotating is a good idea because it's like a game where everyone gets a turn! I vote for Rotating Location!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree that fairness is the most important thing here, and rotating seems the most balanced. I vote for Rotating Location.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,It's the only way to keep the peace in the long run. I vote for Rotating Location.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I'll go with the flow since everyone else is on board. I vote for Rotating Location.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,It is the only choice that ensures a fair distribution of the burden. I vote for Rotating Location.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! We all agreed! I'm glad we found a way to make it fair for everyone!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we could reach a consensus. Now we just need to make sure we coordinate the schedule carefully so it's easy for everyone.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll handle the schedule if it means we can all keep talking to each other without any more rows. Let's just keep it simple.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,"I'll help with the notifications, as long as I'm not the only one doing the legwork. Let's just get this settled and move on.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I will ensure the rotation schedule is documented clearly so there is no ambiguity about when the point moves.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
